START

OPEN Cisco Packet Tracer

ADD one 2960 SWITCH

ADD three PCs:
    PC0
    PC1
    PC2

CONNECT all PCs to the switch
USING Copper Straight-Through cables

ASSIGN IP addresses:

    PC0 = 192.168.1.1
    PC1 = 192.168.1.2
    PC2 = 192.168.1.3

SET subnet mask = 255.255.255.0

OPEN PC0 Command Prompt

EXECUTE ping 192.168.1.2

EXECUTE ping 192.168.1.3

IF ping is successful THEN
    DISPLAY "Connection Successful"
ELSE
    DISPLAY "Connection Failed"
END IF

SAVE network as .pkt file

STOP
